# Help: The kprobes KUnit tests and samples
#
# KPROBES_SANITY_TEST registers kprobes and kretprobes on functions of
# its own and checks they fire, and samples/kprobes/ builds the two
# example modules that probe kernel_clone().
#
# Prerequisites inlined per the self-containment rule:
# - KPROBES, and KUNIT and RUNTIME_TESTING_MENU, the menu holding the
#   test.
# - SAMPLES, the menu of samples/.
#
# Loaded on demand; no builtin/ counterpart needed.
# See: lib/Kconfig.debug
# See: samples/Kconfig
# See: https://docs.kernel.org/trace/kprobes.html
CONFIG_KPROBES=y
CONFIG_KUNIT=y
CONFIG_RUNTIME_TESTING_MENU=y
CONFIG_SAMPLES=y
CONFIG_KPROBES_SANITY_TEST=m
CONFIG_SAMPLE_KPROBES=m
CONFIG_SAMPLE_KRETPROBES=m
